1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,663
Kritis itu adalah\Ndisiplin.

2
00:00:01,663 --> 00:00:03,904
Menurut gue sama\Nseperti lo disiplin

3
00:00:03,904 --> 00:00:06,000
menyimpan uang lo\Nsetiap bulannya.

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,768
Sama seperti disiplin\Nlo setiap pagi

5
00:00:08,768 --> 00:00:11,000
bangun lo beresin\Nitu kasur lo.

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,465
Disiplinnya kayak gimana\Nsih kalau orang

7
00:00:13,465 --> 00:00:16,000
kritis. Menurut gue\Npertanyakan segala hal.

8
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,676
Apapun yang kalian\Nlihat, kalian dengar,

9
00:00:18,676 --> 00:00:21,108
kalian masuk kota\Nkalian itu kalian

10
00:00:21,108 --> 00:00:22,000
pertanyakan.

11
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,045
Bener gak sih\Nini?

12
00:00:23,045 --> 00:00:24,836
Kenapa begitu? Kenapa\Nbegitu?

13
00:00:24,836 --> 00:00:26,552
Start dari satu\Nkata aja tuh

14
00:00:26,552 --> 00:00:27,000
kenapa?

15
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,203
Misalkan kayak lagi\Nbelajar tentang penjajahan

16
00:00:30,203 --> 00:00:32,000
jaman Belanda di\NIndonesia.

17
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,700
Kenapa ya Belanda\Nmenjajah kita?

18
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:37,100
Kenapa ya kok\Nrakyat kita gak

19
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:40,000
ada duitnya gitu\Nkayak diperbudak.
